OL,3,ABrazilian authorities question
OL,4,Awhereabouts of Flavio Bolsonaro after
OL,5,Ahe fails to surrender passports
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolice in Brazil say they have
OL,8,Fcancelled the passports of the defeated
OL,9,Fright-wing presidential candidate,
OL,10,FFlavio Bolsonaro, after he failed to
OL,11,Fcomply with an order to surrender the
OL,12,Fdocuments
OL,14,FOn Monday, the Supreme Court gave
OL,15,FBolsonaro 24 hours to hand his
OL,16,Fpassports over as part of an
OL,17,Finvestigation into alleged corruption
OL,18,Fand money laundering, which he denies
OL,20,FWith the deadline passed, there is
OL,21,Fspeculation he may have left the
OL,22,Fcountry
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
