OL,3,ABrazilian authorities question
OL,4,Awhereabouts of Flavio Bolsonaro after
OL,5,Ahe fails to surrender passports
OL,6,
OL,7,FFederal officers have checked border
OL,8,Fcrossings to establish if Bolsonaro may
OL,9,Fhave travelled to neighbouring
OL,10,FArgentina, a police source tells BBC
OL,11,FNews Brasil
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
